.TH ALI-TERMINAL 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-terminal \- the ALI terminal (xfce4-terminal, branded)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-terminal
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Visible rebrand over xfce4-terminal: ALI window title, ALI-dark
colors from first run, fastfetch billboard on open. All
xfce4-terminal options pass straight through.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xfce4-terminal (1)
